# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# NOTE: App/App/public and the generated config files are committed on purpose
# (against the Capacitor default) so this repo can be opened in Xcode and built
# without first running `npm install && npx cap sync ios`. Refresh them with
# `npm run ios:sync` after changing the game.
